s":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"Dfb1JjoHznL","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Dfb1JjoHznL","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Line 群組裡面有個 Grok Bot 真的超方便\n\nBot 可以做到：\n- 詢問大家方便聚餐的時間\n- 找餐廳給大家選\n- 選好餐廳後直接打開 inline 或 Open Table 網頁訂位\n- 訂完位之後就順便建立行事曆\n- 把行事曆連結丟回到群組\n\n以前還要有個人當主揪\n現在直接把主揪丟給 AI 來當就好","timestamp":"2026-11-07T09:11:50.000Z","stats":{"likes":166,"replies":22,"reposts":12,"shares":102},"score":246,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZZlZDn0RU","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfZZlZDn0RU","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"陪客戶做夢(O)\n陪客戶做自動化(X)\n\n最近對於 AI 模型的進步突然有感而發\n五個月前，同一個客戶需求\n用當時的 opus 只能跑出 6x% 的成功率\n\n而現在只需要 sonnet 5.5 \n就能跑出 99% 以上的成功率\n\n這個場景是客戶流程的一大痛點\n他們會收到一份超多頁的 pdf\n以往都需要人工逐頁處理跟登打\n\n現在因為他們導入了新的 ERP 系統\n系統本身也能很簡單的就跟 AI 做串接\n又享受到 AI 模型的進步\n\n只需要在系統裡面做一部：上傳\n接著就放手交給 AI + 系統處理\n一個 PDF → 一百多筆資料 → 全自動出現在系統\n同仁只需要確認那些 AI 回報信心程度較低的項目就好\n\n一個小時的工作只剩下不到幾分鐘！\n如果你想知道這是哪套 ERP 系統 ↓","timestamp":"2026-11-06T10:32:29.000Z","stats":{"likes":20,"replies":2,"reposts":1,"shares":1},"score":27,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfZZl3NHyAF","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfZZl3NHyAF","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"歡迎洽詢 Odoo ERP \n找 @lupus_rr 評估自己的公司是否適合換成 Odoo\n\n享受簡單易用、又能根據需求客製化的 ERP 系統","timestamp":"2026-11-06T10:32:33.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfWiscZn__A","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfWiscZn__A","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"ChatGPT Images 2.6 有點意思喔\n\n可以出很精準的 svg\n做GIF 效果也不錯\n\n但是做 GIF 應該蠻燒額度的","timestamp":"2026-11-05T07:54:22.000Z","stats":{"likes":21,"replies":4,"reposts":2,"shares":4},"score":35,"first_seen":"2026-11-08T00:49:59+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}